1
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,240
I found it.

2
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,920
Leng Yiheng said in an interview

3
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,920
that he has a younger brother named Leng Yishu.

4
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,800
One 'heng' and one 'shu'.

5
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,080
No wonder it's called Hengshu Group.

6
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,840
So Jin Xi is just his stage name.

7
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,840
His family is so rich, but he didn't tell us.

8
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,240
He made us suffer for nothing.

9
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:06,080
Turn on the air conditioner.

10
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:06,740
Don't rush.

11
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,240
It's not certain if the investment will come in.

12
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,840
It's just going home for a meal.

13
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,440
What's there to hesitate about?

14
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,280
If going back home were that easy,

15
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:17,080
he wouldn't have kept it a secret for so many years.

16
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,800
His problems with his family

17
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,039
might be serious.

18
00:01:20,039 --> 00:01:20,560
Right.

19
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,960
He must have his reasons.

20
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:38,600
Hello.

21
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,800
You finally answered the phone.

22
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,600
Where are you?

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,840
I'm sorry.

24
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,680
My phone died just now.

25
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:47,880
I'm home. Don't worry.

26
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,400
Glad you're fine.

27
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:55,800
Go to bed early then.

28
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,740
See you tomorrow. Good night.

29
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,080
Wait.

30
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:05,240
Why didn't you ask me about Leng Yiheng?

31
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:10,050
You'll tell me when you want to.

32
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,280
If

33
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,920
I don't agree with everyone,

34
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,920
will you guys think I'm selfish?

35
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,850
We haven't been through what you have,

36
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:22,960
so

37
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,040
we have no right to judge.

38
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:27,440
Don't worry.

39
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:31,520
You don't need to be emotionally blackmailed.

40
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:50,840
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, and up.

41
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:56,000
Two, two, three, four, five, six, seven.

42
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:12,480
Sorry,

43
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,360
I forgot.

44
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:13,920
Stop.

45
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:15,840
Again.

46
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,079
Xiao Li.

47
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:19,880
What's wrong, Xiao Li?

48
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:20,360
What happened?

49
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,440
Are you okay, Xiao Li?

50
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,079
What's wrong?

51
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:22,840
What's going on?

52
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,480
Get some rest.

53
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,040
Are you okay?

54
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:25,600
Where do you feel unwell?

55
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:25,960
Are you all right?

56
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:26,820
What happened?

57
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,320
She must have heatstroke.

58
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,720
Director, you can't do this.

59
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,880
You didn't even turn on the AC when we trained so hard.

60
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:32,640
I'm sorry.

61
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,840
It really is my fault.

62
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:34,740
Da Biaojie.

63
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:36,010
Go turn on the AC.

64
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,130
You said you want me to go back with you.

65
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,720
If you go with me,

66
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,600
I will go back.

67
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,920
Isn't this a joke?

68
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,740
I really don't want to go back.

69
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:02,250
But I can't watch the theater troupe disband.

70
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:03,440
Leng Yiheng is my brother.

71
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,040
I know him.

72
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,880
He keeps his word.

73
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,860
Right now, only he can solve our urgent need.

74
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,240
He figured out that I know him,

75
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,840
so he came to me at this time.

76
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,450
I really don't want to return to that home.

77
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,660
You will know when you go back with me.

78
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,000
Sure.

79
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,920
You said you'd go back with me.

80
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,080
Does that mean

81
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,610
we are meeting the parents?

82
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:42,520
You can't be serious for more than three seconds, can you?

83
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,800
Meeting the parents means heading towards...

84
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,720
Never mind.

85
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,840
This character is quite good.

86
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,940
Really? It's not decided yet.

87
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:57,130
What are you whispering about?

88
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,400
Director Xiong's new play is casting actors.

89
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,000
Let me see.

90
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:05,240
Doesn't the time overlap with ours?

91
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,320
What's the point of looking at this?

92
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:06,920
Exactly.

93
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:08,560
You know what?

94
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,080
I'm quite suitable for this heroine.

95
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,410
Let me see the male lead.

96
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,200
What are you doing?

97
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:13,800
Nothing.

98
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,880
It's nothing.

99
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,560
Being so secretive.

100
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,280
There's something wrong with you.

101
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,280
What's there to hide?

102
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:18,880
You're definitely up to something.

103
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,440
No.

104
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:19,840
No.

105
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,650
You are looking at other musicals.

106
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,760
What other musicals?

107
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:32,210
Mr. Qingsong, don't overthink it.

108
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,640
Do you think the funding won't come through,

109
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,760
and the troupe will disband?

110
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,000
No.

111
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,300
Ning Jin treats us so well.

112
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,659
How could we leave her at a time like this?

113
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,200
You are all overthinking it.

114
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:46,920
We were just browsing.

115
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,200
Even if the funding doesn't come through,

116
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:50,600
we will definitely live or die with the troupe.

117
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,280
That's right.

118
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,400
We swear to live or die with Xiyin Troupe.

119
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,800
Besides, the investment could come at any time.

120
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,560
Right.

121
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,560
I'm glad you all have such determination.

122
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,490
Let's rehearse.

123
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,450
Let's go.

124
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,540
Let's go rehearse.

125
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:05,920
Right?

126
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,520
Do you think I'm suitable for

127
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,360
this role?

128
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,560
You are here too.

129
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,040
Feixin.

130
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,330
What a coincidence.

131
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,560
Bai Feixin.

132
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:21,500
Bai Feixin.

133
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:23,840
You're here for the audition?

134
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,640
Aren't you here for the audition too?

135
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,680
I'm looking for someone.

136
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,280
Who are you looking for?

137
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:29,280
You wouldn't know even if I told you.

138
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,290
Let's be honest.

139
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,920
Do you also think

140
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,600
that Jin Xi's brother's investment

141
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,460
is unreliable?

142
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,280
Of course.

143
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,400
How could there be a free lunch in this world,

144
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:40,200
especially one worth millions?

145
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,260
I just felt it was impossible.

146
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,200
Great minds think alike.

147
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,600
Good afternoon, everyone.

148
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,040
I am Xiong Rulin.

149
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:53,240
Welcome to the audition for our musical.

150
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,400
I feel like everyone is a bit nervous.

151
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,360
Don't be nervous.

152
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,240
Next,

153
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:57,760
I will sing a song

154
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,000
for you all

155
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:01,280
that will appear in our musical.

156
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,000
That sounds great.

157
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,240
Thank you.

158
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,000
Dead?

159
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:07,440
Say it again.

160
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,530
Didn't I tell you to keep him alive?

161
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:27,800
Chairman, I brought Yishu back.

162
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,320
Chairman,

163
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,560
the bass here is freshly killed.

164
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:49,200
Very fresh.

165
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,160
Enjoy your meal.

166
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,120
Let's eat.

167
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:02,040
Chairman.

168
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,560
Let me introduce you.

169
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:06,840
This is the director of the musical Yishu is starring in,

170
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,370
Ning Jin.

171
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,920
Why did you think of

172
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,880
investing in their play?

173
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,800
I was thinking that our company

174
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:17,760
is trying to expand into the entertainment sector.

175
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:19,450
Then investing in new media

176
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,660
would be better, wouldn't it?

177
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:26,060
I heard through the grapevine

178
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,840
that the musical Yishu is starring in

179
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:30,040
is facing some financial difficulties.

180
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:31,040
I want to help him.

181
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,040
Does he need help?

182
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,960
Would such a big

183
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,040
star like him

184
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,160
care about your little money?

185
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,720
Yiheng, tell me,

186
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,780
did you also ask him

187
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:51,400
to come back today?

188
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,240
No, Chairman.

189
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:56,250
Yishu wanted to come back and see you himself.

190
00:10:56,680 --> 00:10:57,080
Right?

191
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,100
Director Ning.

192
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:06,120
My son is a disappointment.

193
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:09,040
He's willful and self-centered.

194
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:12,040
He must have caused you a lot of trouble.

195
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,200
Not at all.

196
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:17,000
Jinxi is an excellent and talented artist.

197
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:21,440
He's been very serious about his work since he joined the troupe.

198
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,770
I highly approve of him.

199
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:39,240
We are also dating.

200
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,320
Is this how

201
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,770
you take things seriously?

202
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,200
Why do you artistic people

203
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,680
have no sense of boundaries?

204
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,850
You can say whatever you want about me.

205
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:06,840
But I am serious about Ning Jin.

206
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,120
I hope

207
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,890
she can leave a good impression on you.

208
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:14,960
How am I supposed to have a good impression?

209
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,600
She is the director.

210
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,800
And you are the actor.

211
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,240
When you are working,

212
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,040
she is your boss.

213
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:26,000
What is this called in our company?

214
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:30,640
It's called abusing one's position to have inappropriate relationships.

215
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,320
Yiheng.

216
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,840
I finally got a day off.

217
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,720
You came here just to annoy me,

218
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:43,560
didn't you?

219
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,400
Dad.

220
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:47,170
If this meal makes you uncomfortable,

221
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:49,440
I can leave.

222
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,160
Fine.

223
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:52,880
Yishu.

224
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:53,440
Jinxi.

225
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,040
Yishu.

226
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,440
It's all my fault.

227
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:19,770
Come,

228
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:20,960
let's eat.

229
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:46,450
Mr. Leng.

230
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,660
Please take a look.

231
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:51,800
All right.

232
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,440
We've finished eating,

233
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,440
and taken photos.

234
00:13:56,040 --> 00:13:57,700
There's nothing else, right?

235
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:58,960
Chairman.

236
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:03,040
Yishu said there's no other arrangement today.

237
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:04,840
Don't you like exercising after meals?

238
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,760
How about we play doubles?

239
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,960
You have no strength at all.

240
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:31,440
Don't tell me you can't even beat an old man like me.

241
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,300
Come on, Yishu.

242
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,140
Be serious.

243
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:45,280
You have no masculinity at all.

244
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,240
No wonder you always produce that decadent music.

245
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:50,120
How can you make any good music?

246
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,000
Again.

247
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,120
Yiheng.

248
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:10,850
Are you okay?

249
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,000
Are you alright?

250
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,260
Are you okay, Mr. Leng?

251
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:15,040
What exactly do you want?

252
00:15:15,040 --> 00:15:16,240
Zhang, get the car ready

253
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:18,100
and take Mr. Leng to the hospital.

254
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,320
Is it good?

255
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:23,440
It is.

256
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,000
I have to say,

257
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,860
Mr. Xiong's arrangement is really good.

258
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:30,560
We've been doing period dramas,

259
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:32,480
so a sudden switch to jazz

260
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,680
is quite refreshing.

261
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:37,500
It feels quite interesting to change the style, right?

262
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:47,000
Did you pass?

263
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,930
Of course we did.

264
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:49,440
Passed.

265
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,440
Everyone passed.

266
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:54,040
That's our troupe.

267
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,840
So what do we do next?

268
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,370
You are all here.

269
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,580
How did they know we were here?

270
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,600
How should I know?

271
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,360
We saw Ma's Moments.

272
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,640
Ma.

273
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,040
You know,

274
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,440
I always take photos to share

275
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,840
before I eat.

276
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:13,840
Have a seat first.

277
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,840
What did you all do today?

278
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,240
We got up and sang in the morning.

279
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,240
We weren't together,

280
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:28,960
we...

281
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:34,720
Mr. Xiong's executive director is my friend,

282
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:36,180
and he told me everything.

283
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,120
So you all passed.

284
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:47,240
Mr. Heying,

285
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,360
talk to them.

286
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:52,720
I don't think I have the right to lecture them,

287
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:54,120
after all, a while ago...

288
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,120
Mr. Heying told me

289
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:59,400
if you really decide to go,

290
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,690
you'll have to go over the contract tomorrow.

291
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,840
So,

292
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,440
what do you think?

293
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,359
I...

294
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,319
It's like this.

295
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,720
Everyone has their own ambitions.

296
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,240
If any of you

297
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,080
decide to go,

298
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:35,840
that's between you and Boss Wu.

299
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,440
I have no right to interfere.

300
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:41,840
But if any of you are really going,

301
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:44,980
you don't need to come to tomorrow's rehearsal.

302
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:49,480
We won't be friends anymore.

303
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:52,560
Xiao Qi.

304
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,920
Xiao Qi.

305
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:56,560
Young man.

306
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:57,880
Xiaoqi.

307
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,160
Please wait a moment.

308
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,600
Mr. Leng's car just went to the hospital.

309
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:05,120
The car to pick you up will arrive shortly.

310
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:05,850
Is my brother

311
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,010
going to be okay?

312
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:10,760
Fortunately, his eyes were not injured.

313
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,200
He just suffered some injuries to his brow bone.

314
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,330
Please don't worry.

315
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,120
Okay.

316
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,600
Don't bother sending a car for us.

317
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:18,860
Let's walk for a while.

318
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:36,100
What are you doing?

319
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:37,860
'Singin' in the Rain'.

320
00:18:38,560 --> 00:18:39,690
Does it look like it?

321
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:42,600
You really watched all the musicals I recommended?

322
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:43,320
Of course.

323
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,740
I will watch whatever you recommend.

324
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:54,400
So,

325
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:58,760
why is your relationship with your dad so bad?

326
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:02,890
I don't know why either.

327
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,640
I didn't do anything.

328
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:09,440
Peeing in his antique vase

329
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:12,020
or drawing little turtles on his paintings?

330
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,530
Isn't that too much?

331
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,600
When my mom was around,

332
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:22,160
she always said my dad loved to keep a straight face.

333
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,600
So she would play pranks

334
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:25,760
and drag me along to make him laugh.

335
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:28,400
But now that my mom is gone,

336
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,800
I still want to make my dad happy,

337
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:33,040
but he still gets very angry.

338
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,120
I really can't figure out

339
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:36,840
why he won't let me play the guitar at home.

340
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,200
I think

341
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:42,440
I might know why.

342
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:44,160
Why?

343
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:48,640
Because your brother and your dad

344
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:50,400
are exactly alike.

345
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:53,600
So

346
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:58,040
you must be more like your mom.

347
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:02,760
Your dad doesn't want you to play the guitar

348
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:07,500
probably because he's afraid of being reminded of her.

349
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:09,760
I...

350
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,720
never thought of it that way.

351
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:22,120
Anyway,

352
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,980
thank you so much for everything you've done for me.

353
00:20:28,760 --> 00:20:29,600
I'm willing to

354
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,240
do anything for you.

355
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:00,640
As long as it's nothing serious.

356
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,200
How is it going?

357
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:50,560
Have you heard from Leng Yiheng?

358
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:52,140
Is he investing or not?

359
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:53,650
What's the rush?

360
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,360
If the enemy doesn't move,

361
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,490
I won't move either.

362
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:56,960
Look what time it is.

363
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:57,690
In business,

364
00:21:58,280 --> 00:21:59,810
you shouldn't be too eager.

365
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:05,500
Why haven't they come yet?

366
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,800
Are they really not coming back?

367
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:11,120
Was I too harsh yesterday?

368
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,920
Xiao Qi, don't worry.

369
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:16,800
Trust the people around you.

370
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:47,960
None of you went to sign the contract?

371
00:22:48,320 --> 00:22:48,920
Xiao Qi,

372
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:51,300
thank you for waking us up yesterday.

373
00:22:52,360 --> 00:22:53,600
At a time like this,

374
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:55,440
how could we abandon you?

375
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:57,600
We've made our decision.

376
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:59,920
Whether Jinxi and Ningjin get the investment or not,

377
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:01,560
we won't regret it.

378
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,640
I don't regret it.

379
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:10,200
How is it?

380
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:11,730
How is it, director?

381
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:12,850
How did it go?

382
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:14,220
Move aside.

383
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:17,440
Was the dinner party last night successful?

384
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:20,640
Say something.

385
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,900
It was a total failure.

386
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:25,040
I made my dad hate me even more.

387
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:27,680
And I hurt my brother's eyes.

388
00:23:28,560 --> 00:23:30,490
There's another piece of bad news.

389
00:23:30,640 --> 00:23:33,370
Leng Yiheng probably won't invest in us anymore.

390
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,440
I auditioned for the male lead.

391
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,840
Baby, is it still in time?

392
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:39,400
I'm already calling a car.

393
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:40,240
Traffic jam.

394
00:23:40,760 --> 00:23:41,760
It's too late now.

395
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:43,440
Bai Feixin,

396
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,040
what choice did you make this time?

397
00:23:45,040 --> 00:23:46,960
What about next month's rent?

398
00:23:48,320 --> 00:23:49,120
Eason, hurry up and go.

399
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:49,440
Go quickly.

400
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:51,040
Call him again and try to contact him.

401
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:52,360
This is driving me crazy.

402
00:23:52,360 --> 00:23:53,560
Calm down.

403
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:57,600
I'll make a call.

404
00:23:59,560 --> 00:24:01,080
He didn't answer.

405
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:05,400
I'm already at the door,

406
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:07,400
so there's no need to answer, right?

407
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:09,840
Brother.

408
00:24:10,600 --> 00:24:11,530
Why are you here?

409
00:24:11,760 --> 00:24:12,690
I'm here to sign.

410
00:24:15,040 --> 00:24:16,320
Director Wu, go ahead.

411
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:17,720
This is the cooperation agreement for Hengshu's investment

412
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,240
in your troupe's 'A Chinese Ghost Story' project.

413
00:24:19,240 --> 00:24:20,600
Mr. Leng has already signed it.

414
00:24:20,600 --> 00:24:21,640
Please take a look.

415
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:24,040
If there are no objections, you can sign it.

416
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:27,560
Did I hear that right?

417
00:24:33,040 --> 00:24:33,700
The stamps,

418
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,560
they are all in my pocket.

419
00:24:42,200 --> 00:24:42,660
Come on.

420
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:43,800
Quick.

421
00:24:44,600 --> 00:24:46,360
No more photos. It's not convenient for me today.

422
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:47,400
Still very handsome.

423
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,400
Eason, look here.

424
00:24:51,320 --> 00:24:52,760
Thank you.

425
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:53,360
All right,

426
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,840
I won't disturb you any longer.

427
00:24:54,840 --> 00:24:55,680
I have

428
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:58,040
a meeting in a moment.

429
00:24:58,040 --> 00:24:58,440
I'll go first.

430
00:24:58,440 --> 00:24:59,040
Thank you.

431
00:24:59,240 --> 00:24:59,770
Goodbye.

432
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:00,560
Thank you.

433
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,560
Thank you.

434
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:04,370
Brother.

435
00:25:05,600 --> 00:25:06,800
What's wrong, Yishu?

436
00:25:09,360 --> 00:25:09,760
You...

437
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:13,820
You promised me

438
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:15,640
we'd go home for dinner this weekend.

439
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:16,300
And you did.

440
00:25:19,600 --> 00:25:21,460
I am the producer of this play now.

441
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:24,600
I'll come to see your rehearsals often from now on.

442
00:25:24,600 --> 00:25:25,200
Keep it up.

443
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:27,610
I'm leaving.

444
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:39,840
That's great.
